{"1041320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lords Mobile: Kingdom Wars", "steam_appid": 1041320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are You Ready For A Real Fight?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The true Emperor has fallen. We need a real hero, a true Lord who can unite the Kingdoms. Recruit heroes from various backgrounds, from dwarves and mermaids to dark elves and steampunk robots, and assemble your army in this magical world! Fight and conquer to establish your empire in the strategy games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/93042bbae2a41bd2e979a133f1b0c4e8.poster.avif?t=1785907023\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/93042bbae2a41bd2e979a133f1b0c4e8.webm?t=1785907023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/93042bbae2a41bd2e979a133f1b0c4e8.mp4?t=1785907023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Game Features]:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶▶ Embark on the Guild Expedition ◀◀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a grand Guild vs Guild battle, where multiple guilds compete against each other to expand their territory. Troops will not perish in this special battleground, allowing you to unleash your full potential without any worries! Unite your guild and strategize to conquer the battlefield!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ ▶  Collect Artifacts! ◀◀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient Artifacts in the Artifact Hall. Upgrade and enhance them to unlock their true power! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ ▶ Build Your Own Kingdom ◀◀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade buildings, conduct research, train your troops, level your Heroes and lead your Kingdom well to prosper!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/402800953bc144b03ddb7a1eb1e576c2.poster.avif?t=1785907023\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/402800953bc144b03ddb7a1eb1e576c2.webm?t=1785907023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/402800953bc144b03ddb7a1eb1e576c2.mp4?t=1785907023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ ▶ Utilize Troop Formations ◀◀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different troop types, and 6 different troop formations for you to choose from! Plan your lineups, take advantage of the counter system, and pair your troops with the right Heroes! Perfect your strategy to defeat your enemies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/7fa23750689cc150bf94c6629de09843.poster.avif?t=1785907023\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/7fa23750689cc150bf94c6629de09843.webm?t=1785907023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/7fa23750689cc150bf94c6629de09843.mp4?t=1785907023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ ▶ Forge Alliances ◀◀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a guild to fight alongside your allies! Ride into war together to conquer various exhilarating events. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/b8017d56cc52f8af694806a8f7e97bf8.poster.avif?t=1785907023\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/b8017d56cc52f8af694806a8f7e97bf8.webm?t=1785907023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/b8017d56cc52f8af694806a8f7e97bf8.mp4?t=1785907023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ ▶ Powerful Heroes Await ◀◀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a strong team of 5 Heroes to fight through an RPG-style campaign! Let them lead your kingdom to glory as war generals!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/cd732471b7801183711a68f6f2d5752c.poster.avif?t=1785907023\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/cd732471b7801183711a68f6f2d5752c.webm?t=1785907023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1041320/extras/cd732471b7801183711a68f6f2d5752c.mp4?t=1785907023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >===information===</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customer Service: <a href=\"mailto:Help.lordsmobile.steam@igg.com\">Help.lordsmobile.steam@igg.com</a></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are You Ready For A Real Fight?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The true Emperor has fallen. We need a real hero, a true Lo